<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32174" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησι-άζω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άσω</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Ec.</u>
			161
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Isoc.
			8.2
		</span></i> : impf.<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠκκλησίαζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.265
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				19.60
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκλησίαζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					12.73
				</span></i>
			 codd., but usu. with irreg. augm., as if the Verb were a
			compd. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κλησιάζω,</span>
			impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεκλησίαζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					13.73
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				76
			</span></i> : aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεκλησίασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.93
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.193
			</span></i> (freq. with vv.ll. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεκκλησίαζον,
				ἐξεκκλησίασα</span>) :—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεκκλησιάσατο,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγορήσατο</span>
			, Hsch.s.h.v.:—<i>hold an assembly, debate therein,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1027
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.6.37
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				8.2
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περί μου ἐπ᾽ ὀλέθρῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					84
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ τῆς πόλεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					8.13
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιαῦτα ἐκκλησιάσαντες</span>
			<i>having</i> thus <i>deliberated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.77
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰς ἀναγκαίας ἐκκλησίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1292b28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be a member of the Assembly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀπὸ τιμήματος οὐδενός</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1294b3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>summon to an assembly, convene,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς αὑτοῦ στρατιώτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aen.Tact.
					9.1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					21.16
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συναγωγήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					8.3
				</span></i>
			,al. :—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be called together,</i>ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Je.</u>
				33(26).9
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ πρὸς ἑαυτὸν ἐ.</span>
			<i>summon</i> considerations before one's mind, <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>Hist.</u>
				p.210D.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
